<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>House Inventory System - User Guide</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1> How to add a Location</h1>
    <p>This section walks user through adding a new location to the House Inventory System.</p>

    <h2>Steps to Add a Location</h2>
    <ol>
        <li>Launch the application</li>
        <li>
            Find 'Add Location' button on main page, select and the Add Location window will open.
            <img src="/add_location1.png"
                 alt="Add Location window"
                 style="width:500px; height: 300px; object-position:left; display:block;">
        </li>
        <li>
            Once Add Location window opens you can enter the name of the new location and select the 'Add Location' button at the bottom to save.
            <img src="/add_location2.png"
                 alt="Add Location window opened"
                 style="width:500px; height: 300px; object-position:left; display:block;">
        </li>
        <li>If you decide not to add a new location, simply select the 'Cancel' button a the bottom of the window.</li>
        <li>
            After you have added your new location, the window will close and redirect back to the main page showing your new location. 
            <img src="/add_location3.png"
                 alt="Save new location"
                 style="width:500px; height: 300px; object-position:left; display:block;">
        </li>
    </ol>
</body>
</html>